    "name": "Engagement survey",
    "description": "The quarterly engagement survey: six short pages of agreement questions (Engagement, Leadership, Growth, Wellbeing, Belonging, Recognition), how likely you are to recommend working here (eNPS) and one open comment. Each answer starts the Survey response workflow, which seals it until the survey closes.",
